node_modules/
dist/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store
.vitest-reports/

# Reference one-pagers. Labelled internal collateral, never committed.
samples/

# One-question measurement scripts, written to settle a rule and kept only until
# they have. What one holds is often an observation about a real document, which
# is why the directory as a whole stays out.
/probes/

# A corpus of real documents to sweep, and whatever a sweep writes about one.
# Other people's work: it is found through DOCX_PAGES_CORPUS and lives outside
# the repository, and this is here in case anyone puts one inside it.
#
# Anchored to the root on purpose. Unanchored, it also swallowed the code that
# does the sweeping, `packages/render/src/corpus`, which is this repository's own
# code.
/corpus/

# No document of anyone's, wherever it is put. Everything that writes one writes it
# under `samples/`, so this catches only a mistake: a document dropped at the root
# to look at, or a tool told to write outside its own directory. Nothing of these
# kinds has ever been committed and none ever should be, so the rule costs nothing.
# The authored documents are generated rather than kept, and the font files the
# fonts package ships are deliberately not named here.
*.docx
*.doc
*.dotx
*.rtf
*.pdf
*.emf
*.wmf

# Working notes, not part of the library.
BRIEF.md
